<title>CANADA: Peruvian Gold closes warrant placement.</title>
<headline>Peruvian Gold closes warrant placement.</headline>
<dateline>VANCOUVER 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peruvian Gold Ltd said on Friday it had closed the previously announced private placement of 3.0 million special warrants at C$4.50 each.</p>
<p>Each special warrant is exchangeable into one unit of one common share and one half of a non-transfareable share purchase warrant. Each warrant is exercisable for the purchase of an additional share at C$6 per share for two years.</p>
<p>The proceeds of C$13.5 million will be used for further exploration and drilling programs on the La Bonita concession in Ecuador and for working capital purposes, it said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto bureau 416 941-8100</p>
